msgctxt "112"
msgid ""
"You can bet on what number will show on one of the two dice.\r\n"
"If you guess right, you can earn even more tags than by simply guessing odd "
"or even."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"You can also bet on which numbers will show on both dice.\r\n"
"If you guess right, you get all of the money\r\n"
"in the current pot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"However, you must wager 20％ of the betting\r\n"
"limit in order to make your bet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"To play against the house, first place a bet as to whether\r\n"
"the numbers will be odd or even. Guess right, and the tags\r\n"
"you win become your bet against the house. When\r\n"
"playing against the house, you will guess either odd or\r\n"
"even. Guess right, and you win double the tags you bet.\r\n"
"Up to five rolls are possible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"Cho-han is a game where you guess if the sum of a pair\r\n"
"of dice rolled will be odd or even."
msgstr ""

